WEBVTT

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.100
Hikari.

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:07.780
I'm Takeru. Takeru Takemoto.

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:21.760
<i>No matter how bored you feel each day,.</i>

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:26.040
<i>if you're a normal high school student, nothing can be done.</i>

00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:31.830
<i>But, after saving a girl who appeared in a light, I guess you can't say that anymore.</i>

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:37.830
<i>Was it really okay to say, "I'll protect you!"?</i>

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:46.660
Whisper goodbye to the unsightly world,.

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:53.410
and embellish its entirety with those crimson wings.

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:06.580
The filthier this world becomes,.

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:10.760
the dearer its living things are.

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:18.290
The more I hate it, the stronger my desire to embrace it.

00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:24.950
Staring intently at a mirror reveals my dark side.

00:01:25.630 --> 00:01:30.670
People hide their weaknesses,.

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:37.870
by hurting those who are kind.

00:01:38.170 --> 00:01:44.810
Whisper goodbye to the unsightly world,.

00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:50.330
and dance around it gloriously with those crimon wings.

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:53.880
Please kiss me passionately,.

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:56.660
as often as you want,.

00:01:57.010 --> 00:02:02.850
if you notice my heart raging violently.

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:09.370
So I might change once more.

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:17.260
Takeru-kun?

00:02:18.920 --> 00:02:20.360
Hey, Takeru-kun!

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:25.250
Mari...

00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:28.010
Takeru-kun, why are you sleeping in a place like this?

00:02:28.420 --> 00:02:33.110
Well, because... um...

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:47.700
N-Not here. There... okay?

00:02:48.130 --> 00:02:50.570
Why? I want to be with you.

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:13.900
I'm... going to sleep out here so... good night.

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:19.400
Okay...

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:22.520
<i>Where is this?</i>

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:25.800
<i>There's nothing... Nothing at all.</i>

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:27.730
<i>Complete darkness.</i>

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:32.550
<i>Where... am I?</i>

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:55.310
<i>I'm Takeru. Takeru Takemoto.</i>

00:03:57.310 --> 00:03:58.530
Takeru...

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:05.140
I-It's nothing. It was just a bit hot last night...

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:07.960
You're hiding something in there, aren't you?

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:10.680
What's this all of a sudden?

00:04:11.420 --> 00:04:14.510
I bet you picked up an adult magazine by the dry riverbed again and-

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:24.900
Ah... um... good morning, Takeru, Mari!

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:30.470
In other words, what are you saying?

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:34.790
It means that this case is no longer our concern.

00:04:35.280 --> 00:04:37.070
Who the heck are they?

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:37.920
No idea.

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:41.680
Besides that, what a terrible smell...

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.450
Chief, a mask.

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:47.060
I don't need it.

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:50.560
I like these kind of smells.

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:53.930
Is it true that Takeru has comitted a sex offense!?

00:04:54.570 --> 00:04:56.180
You're going to elope with a married woman!?

00:04:57.170 --> 00:04:59.100
Chip in because you have a kid now?

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:01.310
You're so perverted, Takeru!

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:03.730
Mari, what did you tell them!?

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:07.810
First of all, let's hear your story.

00:05:09.860 --> 00:05:14.760
You left the broken bike in the garage and didn't report the delivery!

00:05:15.270 --> 00:05:18.180
I'm sorry. A lot happened last night.

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:22.890
S-So that's why...

00:05:23.730 --> 00:05:25.500
I don't get any of this.

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:26.390
Yeah, really...

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:28.890
But, we're not lying.

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:29.900
Ryou!

00:05:30.310 --> 00:05:31.010
Ryou-sama!

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:38.470
I'll hear the details after dinner!

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:44.600
So you're saying that a mysterious dancing light turned into a person?

00:05:44.700 --> 00:05:46.060
Does that mean she's an alien?

00:05:46.060 --> 00:05:48.880
But are aliens supposed to be this cute?

00:05:49.170 --> 00:05:54.850
Well, an alien could be like a floppy green octopus, or small and gray.

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:59.720
What are you talking about? When you say "alien", it has to be an ogress wearing a tiger-print bikini!

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:04.240
Don't forget the pink-haired teacher who wears glasses, loves candy, and unintentionally becomes someone's wife!

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:04.970
Moron.

00:06:05.220 --> 00:06:05.680
I...

00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:13.030
I was just wandering around. Amidst a cluster of stars that did not glitter.

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:17.140
It was vast, silent, and barren.

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:21.380
I didn't even realize I had a body until now.

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:26.080
So you weren't an alien or even an individual?

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:30.500
Um, I guess so.

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:36.060
There's also the mystery of us being able to communicate naturally.

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:41.250
What's more, she already knew my name the first time we met.

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:43.680
I didn't tell her anything!

00:06:44.050 --> 00:06:48.850
Ah, about that, it's not just Mari, I know about all of you.

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:50.140
Ryou...

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:52.470
Sakurako and Amika.

00:06:53.150 --> 00:06:55.000
Shinichi and Daijirou.

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:58.010
The people from earlier were Icchou and Sumie.

00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:02.970
Come to think of it, you weren't able to talk this much last night, right?

00:07:03.510 --> 00:07:04.980
I... guess so.

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:08.970
I don't know why either.

00:07:09.560 --> 00:07:12.100
You don't even know anything about yourself?

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:14.890
It can't be helped. It's not Hikari's fault.

00:07:15.340 --> 00:07:19.100
But, don't you at least remember why you came here?

00:07:19.610 --> 00:07:24.810
I do, I... don't know how to say this but I...

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:27.100
Wow, she's troubled.

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:31.800
It's no wonder, since she's trying to put the deep profound mystery of space into words.

00:07:39.010 --> 00:07:39.970
I was lonely.

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:49.270
You're no longer lonely after meeting Takeru?

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:55.180
Yes. Takeru called me "Hikari" and gave me a warm embrace.

00:07:57.600 --> 00:08:01.180
Takeru spoke kindly to me.

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:07.760
That's the only irreplaceable truth inside me now.

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:14.300
Takeru is my precious first person.

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:19.560
You like Takeru, right?

00:08:20.210 --> 00:08:20.910
Yes!

00:08:21.380 --> 00:08:23.910
Who cares about space anyway?

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:26.450
Absolutely. And thank you for your comment.

00:08:27.470 --> 00:08:29.100
Ta-ke-ru!

00:08:30.140 --> 00:08:34.510
Based on the data we analysed, its skeletal structure appears to be very primitive,.

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:41.040
and its characteristics resemble those of large ancient arthropods...

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:44.880
That's indeed mysterious as well but...

00:08:44.880 --> 00:08:45.310
Yes?

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:49.000
How do you explain the situation here?

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:53.220
If this is the aftermath of a barbecue, they must've had terrible manners.

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:02.710
You really don't have to help.

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:04.720
You're our guest, Hikari.

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:06.920
Please let me help!

00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:11.130
I want Takeru to eat the food I made, too.

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:14.500
Here I go!

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:19.500
So, you transformed and fought to protect Hikari?

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:21.380
How about trying it now?

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:24.100
I would if I could, I was frantic that time!

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:28.470
Who cares about your transformation anyway?

00:09:28.530 --> 00:09:31.760
Yeah, if Hikari did it it would be a different story...

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:34.800
Oh yeah! We can get her to do that!

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:35.600
Idiots!

00:09:49.070 --> 00:09:49.930
Let's eat!

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:52.800
Thanks for the meal!

00:09:53.020 --> 00:09:55.980
Anyway, why don't we get Hikari some clothes?

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:59.220
Yeah, we can't let her wear that forever.

00:10:01.190 --> 00:10:03.220
I'm okay with this-

00:10:03.220 --> 00:10:03.680
No!

00:10:04.690 --> 00:10:07.680
For a girl, before worrying about space,.

00:10:07.680 --> 00:10:09.810
it's much more important to worry about what you wear!

00:10:10.620 --> 00:10:13.100
Didn't I make you a lot of things, Mari?

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:15.200
Why don't you lend her some?

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:18.070
My... you mean those?!

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:19.870
Yeah, that's a good idea!

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:23.920
They were all made for you but some of them haven't even been worn once.

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:25.880
No.

00:10:25.880 --> 00:10:28.870
Why? You haven't even tried them on.

00:10:29.210 --> 00:10:30.940
Yeah, it's such a waste!

00:10:31.260 --> 00:10:32.590
No means no!

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:35.470
How could anyone wear such embarrassing clothes?

00:10:35.470 --> 00:10:37.220
Besides, they won't even fit her!

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:40.270
Then why not use the material to make new things?

00:10:40.270 --> 00:10:42.220
That's it! Nice, Amika!

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:44.660
Why are you upset?

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:45.850
I'm not upset!

00:10:46.180 --> 00:10:48.080
Let's get started then.

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:50.080
Hey, Hikari. Get up, get up!

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:50.910
Y-Yes.

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:52.970
Hey, don't do it in my room!

00:10:52.970 --> 00:10:55.290
Takeru, you understand, right?

00:10:55.690 --> 00:10:56.600
Come here.

00:10:56.970 --> 00:10:58.600
Y-Yes.

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:00.350
I'll come along.

00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:01.970
Takeru?

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:03.940
Too bad.

00:11:03.940 --> 00:11:05.260
Well, it can't be helped.

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:09.810
86 cm.

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:13.140
A beauty from space indeed.

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:14.730
Is that so?

00:11:18.460 --> 00:11:19.910
85 cm!

00:11:19.690 --> 00:11:20.620
I want to see.

00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:21.390
Hey, Mari!

00:11:21.390 --> 00:11:22.190
Stop that.

00:11:22.270 --> 00:11:25.720
In that room, the mystery of space is currently being...

00:11:26.170 --> 00:11:27.640
Hm, is something like this good?

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:29.060
Let's use this for the skirt.

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:31.720
Maybe more dark grey or silver since she's from space.

00:11:32.530 --> 00:11:35.390
Why not? Her hair and eyes are both bright.

00:11:36.350 --> 00:11:37.720
You're probably right.

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:44.420
Oh, the troublemaker has returned.

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:46.170
How was the lecture?

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:48.100
You guys are still here?

00:11:48.570 --> 00:11:50.370
We want to finish it by tonight.

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:52.940
Be sure to call home at least.

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:55.720
I'm going home. My little sister is waiting.

00:11:55.820 --> 00:11:57.960
No way, Ryou-sama!

00:11:59.550 --> 00:12:00.810
See you, Hikari.

00:12:03.810 --> 00:12:04.510
Hikari...

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:08.510
Well Takeru, it's our turn.

00:12:08.610 --> 00:12:11.000
Why don't we spend some time talking about the future?

00:12:12.020 --> 00:12:14.290
Give me a break!

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:27.490
Who might you be?

00:12:43.890 --> 00:12:46.310
These are my clothes, right?

00:12:46.810 --> 00:12:47.610
Takeru,.

00:12:49.090 --> 00:12:49.960
how do I look?

00:12:50.590 --> 00:12:51.310
Does it look good on me?

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:52.360
Y...

00:12:53.020 --> 00:12:53.900
Y...?

00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:58.470
Shut up! I don't know anything about clothes!

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:03.280
Guys, how long do you plan on doing this? If we don't hurry, we'll be late!

00:13:03.280 --> 00:13:04.910
Crap, I totally forgot!

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:07.300
I brought my uniform and school bag.

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:09.120
We have to go home first!

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:10.480
I live next door anyway.

00:13:10.030 --> 00:13:11.250
- Takeru-kun, you too!

00:13:11.250 --> 00:13:12.180
O-Okay.

00:13:14.070 --> 00:13:17.990
That won't do. You have to tell her it looks good on her.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:19.720
She'll get fed up with you.

00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:21.430
Shut up!

00:13:38.340 --> 00:13:39.830
It's so hot!

00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:42.560
Japan is completely tropical!

00:13:45.870 --> 00:13:46.380
Good afternoon.

00:13:49.440 --> 00:13:51.700
What a nice outfit you're wearing.

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:53.660
Is that fashionable around here?

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:59.220
The people here made it for me because I told them I'm from outer space.

00:13:59.820 --> 00:14:00.560
Outer space?

00:14:00.950 --> 00:14:05.640
Um, are people from space really that rare?

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:08.850
You have a very mysterious scent.

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:11.170
Do I smell?

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:16.130
Come, let's take a shower together.

00:14:16.470 --> 00:14:19.390
Despite my appearance, I know a lot about living beings.

00:14:20.280 --> 00:14:23.140
I'll see if you're really an alien or not.

00:14:25.110 --> 00:14:28.070
<i>This scent... What was it?</i>

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:31.180
Wow! Look what we have here.

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:33.500
You have a great body.

00:14:34.030 --> 00:14:35.740
Probably second to mine.

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:36.870
Is that so?

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:43.020
But biologically, you look just like a normal human being.

00:14:43.670 --> 00:14:46.760
Any way I look, you seem like a fine Earthling.

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:48.510
I see...

00:14:49.380 --> 00:14:51.860
Oh, did I say something wrong?

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:55.930
I don't know.

00:14:56.530 --> 00:14:59.930
I see. It's bothering you, isn't it?

00:15:00.450 --> 00:15:04.430
You're the same yet you're different... You're different yet you're the same...

00:15:04.890 --> 00:15:10.390
I'm here, yet I don't know anything about myself.

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:14.640
That's why I can't get close to anyone, or be separated from them, either.

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:17.890
Why couldn't I have been something else!?

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:23.900
It'd be nice to be open like this with everyone...

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:26.400
But I guess that's impossible.

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:42.080
Incredible, Hikari! You transform when you drink beer!

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:45.080
She's a blonde-haired foreigner with big boobs!

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:45.600
No way.

00:15:45.950 --> 00:15:50.600
What's with you guys? It's rude to stare at someone like that.

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:56.470
If you're looking for a girl named Hikari, she just left.

00:15:56.940 --> 00:15:58.560
Left? Where to?

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:01.680
Beats me, how would I know?

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:05.440
Um, are you the person who'll be staying with us starting today?

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:09.180
Yup, Jennifer Portman. Nice to meet you!

00:16:09.770 --> 00:16:10.570
Takeru!

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:11.930
We have to find Hikari!

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:13.780
Oh, he's gone.

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:14.650
Ryou is gone too!

00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:17.470
Mari, we should go too.

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:21.390
I... have to show this person around.

00:16:22.030 --> 00:16:24.910
She was really happy with the clothes we made her.

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:28.050
This way. But please put on some clothes first.

00:16:28.640 --> 00:16:29.740
We're going, okay?

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:34.360
What is it?

00:16:34.700 --> 00:16:36.970
This is just my hypothesis, but...

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:40.350
You're quite the jealous type, aren't you?

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:43.390
Jealous? What are you talking about?

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:46.640
A girl from space suddenly appears.

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:49.410
She's cute and has big breasts.

00:16:49.580 --> 00:16:55.350
Plus, she's true to herself and can express her feelings for him directly whereas you could not.

00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:57.600
She's a pretty tough rival.

00:16:58.220 --> 00:17:06.190
Jealousy, you say? Me and Takeru-kun are cousins... and I didn't even know I liked him so...

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:08.850
I didn't know what to do.

00:17:09.220 --> 00:17:11.350
And that's why you were so mean to her?

00:17:11.980 --> 00:17:15.510
No! I'm not that kind of person!

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:19.010
If that's how you really feel, go for it.

00:17:19.440 --> 00:17:22.100
Love triangles are more interesting that way.

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:26.640
I-I can't do that! ...that's... too embarrassing...

00:17:27.320 --> 00:17:30.150
You aren't taking full control of yourself.

00:17:30.680 --> 00:17:35.640
Honestly, very few can assert what kind of people they really are.

00:17:36.250 --> 00:17:40.130
I don't want to believe that I'm wrong.

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:41.260
But!

00:17:41.780 --> 00:17:43.560
Sorry for meddling in.

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:49.720
Takeru-kun!

00:18:02.490 --> 00:18:04.230
<i>I'm sorry, Takeru.</i>

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:07.340
<i>Mom was lonely.</i>

00:18:30.470 --> 00:18:31.270
Mom.

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:32.970
Takeru!

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:35.760
We should go too. Takeru!

00:18:36.310 --> 00:18:39.230
Go? Where should we go?!

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:43.540
<i>In the end, I didn't understand anything about Hikari.</i>

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:45.800
<i>Is she really... going to leave too?</i>

00:18:46.510 --> 00:18:48.350
What are you giving up for?!

00:18:48.860 --> 00:18:51.430
She only has you now, right?

00:18:51.590 --> 00:18:56.630
If you won't be the first to accept her, who will!?

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:02.760
<i>Hikari.</i>

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:05.760
<i>Hikari came to Earth because she was lonely.</i>

00:19:06.300 --> 00:19:08.760
<i>Hikari was alone and came to Earth alone.</i>

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:13.270
<i>She can't even remember her own past and doesn't know anyone.</i>

00:19:13.660 --> 00:19:19.200
<i>I've only been worrying about myself and haven't even thought about how lonely she must be...</i>

00:19:19.580 --> 00:19:21.300
<i>Even though I said I'd protect her!</i>

00:19:33.140 --> 00:19:34.310
It's cold.

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:35.310
Hikari!

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:38.650
Takeru?

00:19:40.090 --> 00:19:41.970
I'm glad I found you, Hikari.

00:19:42.510 --> 00:19:50.510
Um, I wanted to take a walk to clear my mind but this is the only place I know, so...

00:19:51.570 --> 00:19:53.390
You only just came to Earth!

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:57.760
Where else would you go other than here and my house?

00:19:58.470 --> 00:19:59.390
Takeru...

00:19:59.910 --> 00:20:01.180
You're Hikari!

00:20:01.710 --> 00:20:02.780
I named you!

00:20:03.660 --> 00:20:06.280
Not just your name! You're you!

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:07.110
What's wrong with that?

00:20:07.860 --> 00:20:10.390
I'll always be by your side.

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:13.390
I don't care if you don't want me around!

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:17.750
It's okay for me to be here, right?

00:20:18.260 --> 00:20:20.140
It's okay for me to be Hikari, right?

00:20:20.560 --> 00:20:22.720
Yes! You are Hikari!

00:20:23.440 --> 00:20:29.510
I'm so happy. I love you and everyone else!

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:34.190
That's right. She's not an alien, she's Hikari.

00:20:34.480 --> 00:20:35.180
Yeah.

00:20:36.980 --> 00:20:39.220
<i>What the heck am I doing?</i>

00:20:45.730 --> 00:20:49.290
Well, I guess a lot happened to me when I was young too...

00:20:49.440 --> 00:20:51.040
No kidding...

00:20:55.160 --> 00:20:57.900
Well, I can't say much about others.

00:20:57.900 --> 00:20:59.600
As long as you're really prepared for this.

00:21:01.080 --> 00:21:05.650
<i>And so, Hikari started living two rooms away from me.</i>

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:12.570
<i>That weird Jennifer lady lives in the room next to me.</i>

00:21:13.680 --> 00:21:17.090
<i>I hear she's a very intelligent scientist but...</i>

00:21:26.940 --> 00:21:27.820
Takeru!

00:21:28.170 --> 00:21:30.280
Takeru, Takeru!

00:21:30.280 --> 00:21:31.420
Hey, Takeru!

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:32.900
Wake up!

00:21:33.670 --> 00:21:36.060
Shut up, I'm awake.

00:21:36.760 --> 00:21:38.930
You can never wake up on your own...

00:21:41.300 --> 00:21:41.930
...Takeru?

00:21:45.060 --> 00:21:46.010
We're leaving!

00:21:46.120 --> 00:21:47.830
Take care!

00:22:24.270 --> 00:22:30.640
The sun aims straight at us.

00:22:31.080 --> 00:22:35.690
I want a tan from the bright summer light.

00:22:36.260 --> 00:22:43.820
I wonder in what way today is going to change me.

00:22:43.820 --> 00:22:48.190
Despite some worries, it'll still be great.

00:22:49.840 --> 00:22:55.410
A part of summer bursts, jumps, and boils,.

00:22:55.710 --> 00:23:01.370
hitting the sky, ocean, and world.

00:23:01.710 --> 00:23:03.100
Hold me.

00:23:03.100 --> 00:23:09.330
What will you do when I whisper those words to you?

00:23:09.330 --> 00:23:14.040
I don't want precarious affection.

00:23:15.810 --> 00:23:22.080
Since a hunch can become truth in an instant,.

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:25.830
in this hot season.

00:23:42.370 --> 00:23:43.850
I'm Hikari.

00:23:44.690 --> 00:23:47.380
I hear Ryou's been acting strange lately.

00:23:47.870 --> 00:23:50.180
Something seems to be on his mind all the time.

00:23:52.140 --> 00:23:56.240
Maybe he's looking for someone.

00:23:57.000 --> 00:23:59.340
Someone he hasn't met yet.

00:24:00.230 --> 00:24:03.130
Next time on This Ugly and Beautiful World,.

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:04.610
Tree Shade for Two.

00:24:05.170 --> 00:24:08.350
By the way, you've been here for awhile. Who are you?
